<title>BRAZIL: Trade in Brazil's Casa Anglo suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Brazil's Casa Anglo suspended.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it suspended trade in Brazilian retailer Casa Anglo on Friday.  </p>
<p>No details on the suspension were immediately available, the bourse said.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
